{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJwslsaHHn6FtTq6r6zU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking what to build next in the Nectar design. I start with the design tokens on the workspace page: primary #53B175, pressed #489E68, tint #EDF7F0, ink #181725, secondary #7C7C7C, muted #B1B1B1, border #E2E2E2, error #F3603F, warning #F7B23B, white #FFFFFF. Radii run 8, 12, 16, 19 for buttons, 24 for cards. Type is Poppins: 30/38 SemiBold for display, 26/32 and 22/30 SemiBold for headings, 20/28 for titles, 16/24 Regular for body, 14/20 for labels, 12/16 for captions.\n\nThen the shared components section at x=1600 on the workspace page, in two batches. Batch 1: 5 tab bar variants (Shop, Explore, Cart, Favourite, Account), each 414×92 with a 1px top border and 5 columns of 82.8, icon 24 over label 12; 3 headers (back chevron in a 40×40 hit area with centered SemiBold 20 title, a title-only header, a logo-plus-location header for \"Dhaka, Banasree\"); a search bar 364×52 at radius 15 filled #F2F3F2 with the magnifier icon and \"Search Store\" in #7C7C7C; a code box 70×70 at radius 12 with a #E2E2E2 stroke.\n\nBatch 2: a grid product card 173×250 (image box 173×120 at radius 16 filled #F2F3F2 with the photo set to FIT, name 16 SemiBold, unit 14 in gray, price 18 SemiBold, 28px green plus button); a category card 173×190; a cart row 364×110 with a 70px image, stepper 100×40 showing - 1 +, and a remove X; a checkout row 364×72 with title, subtitle and chevron.\n\nReuse comes from the reference nodes: instances of the primary button 6:29 for every CTA, instances of the text field 6:35 with label overrides, and instances of the shell components on each frame. For a card instance I find the child named \"Image\" and replace its imageHash, so 6 beverage products, the 2 exclusive offers and the 2 best-sellers all come from one component. Icon instances get recolored by finding the VECTOR child, which is why inspecting Icon_Chevron_Right and Icon_Google_White is unnecessary; they are instanced and recolored rather than rebuilt.\n\nOne layout decision affects everything downstream: 05_Home carries all of the exclusive, best-selling and groceries content, so I size it 414×1218 with the tab bar pinned at the bottom rather than clipping it to 896, and note the vertical scroll.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":8812,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":38140,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":8812}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ad82c274-46fa-45a8-a72d-d1f0c2787158","uuid":"81c5e772-3b31-45aa-a32a-29a6fa5d5ea3","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:40:47.300Z","thinking_duration_ms":101889}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJwslsaHHn6FtTq6r6zU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The scaffold and reference structure are in place. Now the design-system layer: every reusable component the screens will lean on — buttons, fields, search, headers, the five-tab navigation bar, product/category cards, cart and checkout rows. I'll build them all in one pass so later screen sections just place instances."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":8812,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":38140,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":8812}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ad82c274-46fa-45a8-a72d-d1f0c2787158","uuid":"f4a70e18-a19f-4d90-8d7b-6153ea1d5296","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:40:49.006Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJwslsaHHn6FtTq6r6zU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01dlS0RTu614DuqMEThzY7NB","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const ws = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nawait Promise.all(['Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold'].map(s=>figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Poppins',style:s})));\nawait figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Inter',style:'Semi Bold'});\nconst C={green:'#53B175',greenDark:'#489E68',soft:'#EDF7F0',ink:'#181725',gray:'#7C7C7C',muted:'#B1B1B1',line:'#E2E2E2',bg:'#F7F8F7',error:'#F3603F',warn:'#F7B23B',white:'#FFFFFF'};\nfunction rgb(h){h=h.replace('#','');return {r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255};}\nfunction fl(h,op){const c=rgb(h);if(op!==undefined)c.a=op;return [{type:'SOLID',color:c}];}\nfunction txt(p,name,s,o={}){const t=figma.createText();t.name=name;t.fontName={family:'Poppins',style:o.style||'Regular'};t.characters=s;t.fontSize=o.size||16;t.fills=fl(o.color||C.ink);t.textAutoResize='NONE';const hh=o.h||Math.round((o.size||16)*1.5);t.resize(o.w||200,hh);t.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:o.lh||hh};t.textAlignHorizontal=o.align||'LEFT';t.textAlignVertical='CENTER';p.appendChild(t);t.x=o.x||0;t.y=o.y||0;return t;}\nfunction rect(p,name,x,y,w,h,o={}){const r=figma.createRectangle();r.name=name;r.resize(w,h);r.x=x;r.y=y;r.fills=o.fill?fl(o.fill):[];if(o.stroke){r.strokes=fl(o.stroke);r.strokeWeight=o.sw||1;r.strokeAlign='INSIDE';}r.cornerRadius=o.r||0;if(o.rTop!==undefined){r.topLeftRadius=o.rTop;r.topRightRadius=o.rTop;}p.appendChild(r);return r;}\nfunction frame(p,name,x,y,w,h,o={}){const f=figma.createFrame();f.name=name;f.resize(w,h);f.x=x;f.y=y;f.fills=o.fill?fl(o.fill):[];if(o.stroke){f.strokes=fl(o.stroke);f.strokeWeight=o.sw||1;f.strokeAlign='INSIDE';}f.cornerRadius=o.r||0;f.clipsContent=!!o.clip;p.appendChild(f);return f;}\nfunction comp(name,x,y,w,h,o={}){const c=figma.createComponent();c.name=name;c.resize(w,h);c.x=x;c.y=y;c.fills=o.fill?fl(o.fill):[];c.cornerRadius=o.r||0;c.clipsContent=o.clip!==false;ws.appendChild(c);return c;}\nfunction recolor(n,hex){const c=rgb(hex);n.findAll(m=>['VECTOR','ELLIPSE','RECTANGLE','BOOLEAN_OPERATION','POLYGON','STAR'].includes(m.type)).forEach(m=>{try{if(m.fills&&m.fills.length)m.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:{...c}}];if(m.strokes&&m.strokes.length)m.strokes=[{type:'SOLID',color:{...c}}];}catch(e){}});}\nasync function icon(p,id,x,y,size,hex){const src=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);const i=src.createInstance();p.appendChild(i);const sc=size/src.width;i.rescale(sc);i.x=x;i.y=y;if(hex)recolor(i,hex);return i;}\n\nconst lbl=txt(ws,'lib label','NECTAR · DESIGN SYSTEM — components in use across 03 · Workspace',{size:14,style:'SemiBold',color:'#B1B1B1'});lbl.x=1600;lbl.y=0;lbl.resize(1400,24);\n\n// ---------- Buttons ----------\nconst bPrimary=comp('Button / Primary',1600,60,364,67,{fill:C.green,r:19});\ntxt(bPrimary,'Label','Get Started',{size:18,style:'SemiBold',color:C.white,w:364,h:27,align:'CENTER',y:20});\nconst bDisabled=comp('Button / Disabled',1600,150,364,67,{fill:'#CFE7D9',r:19});\ntxt(bDisabled,'Label','Add To Basket',{size:18,style:'SemiBold',color:'#FFFFFF',w:364,h:27,align:'CENTER',y:20});\nconst bSocial=comp('Button / Social',1600,240,364,64,{fill:C.white,r:19,stroke:C.line});\ntxt(bSocial,'Label','Continue with Google',{size:16,style:'SemiBold',color:C.ink,w:250,h:24,y:20,x:80});\nawait icon(bSocial,'4:139',44,20,22,'#4285F4');\nconst bSocialF=comp('Button / Social Facebook',1600,320,364,64,{fill:C.white,r:19,stroke:C.line});\ntxt(bSocialF,'Label','Continue with Facebook',{size:16,style:'SemiBold',color:C.ink,w:270,h:24,y:20,x:78});\nawait icon(bSocialF,'4:133',44,20,22,'#1877F2');\n\n// ---------- Search ----------\nconst search=comp('Search Bar',1600,410,364,52,{fill:C.bg,r:15});\nawait icon(search,'4:160',18,16,18,C.gray);\ntxt(search,'Placeholder','Search Store',{size:15,style:'Medium',color:C.gray,w:250,h:22,x:48,y:15});\n\n// ---------- Headers ----------\nconst hBack=comp('Header / Back',2020,60,414,56,{fill:C.white});\nconst bk=await icon(hBack,'4:124',12,16,20,C.ink);bk.rotation=180;\ntxt(hBack,'Title','Beverages',{size:20,style:'SemiBold',color:C.ink,w:240,h:28,align:'CENTER',x:87,y:14});\nconst hPlain=comp('Header / Title',2020,140,414,56,{fill:C.white});\ntxt(hPlain,'Title','Find Products',{size:20,style:'SemiBold',color:C.ink,w:300,h:28,x:24,y:14});\nconst hBackBig=comp('Header / Back + Subtitle',2020,220,414,84,{fill:C.white});\nconst bk2=await icon(hBackBig,'4:124',12,18,20,C.ink);bk2.rotation=180;\ntxt(hBackBig,'Title','Product Detail',{size:20,style:'SemiBold',color:C.ink,w:240,h:26,align:'CENTER',x:87,y:12});\ntxt(hBackBig,'Sub','Fruits',{size:14,color:C.gray,w:240,h:20,align:'CENTER',x:87,y:40});\n\n// ---------- Code box ----------\nconst codeBox=comp('Code Input / Empty',2020,340,74,74,{fill:'#F9FAF9',r:14,stroke:C.line});\nconst cbf=rect(codeBox,'Line',37,60,1,0,{fill:C.line});\ntxt(codeBox,'Digit','',{size:26,style:'SemiBold',color:C.ink,w:74,h:74,align:'CENTER'});\n\n// ---------- Quantity stepper ----------\nconst step=comp('Quantity Stepper',2020,450,110,40,{fill:C.white,r:12,stroke:C.line});\nrect(step,'Minus',12,19,12,2,{fill:C.green,r:1});\nrect(step,'Plus-H',86,19,12,2,{fill:C.green,r:1});\nrect(step,'Plus-V',91,14,2,12,{fill:C.green,r:1});\ntxt(step,'Qty','1',{size:16,style:'SemiBold',color:C.ink,w:30,h:22,align:'CENTER',x:40,y:9});\n\n// ---------- Tab bars ----------\nconst tabs=[['Shop','4:163'],['Explore','4:130'],['Cart','4:121'],['Favourite','4:136'],['Account','4:118']];\nconst tabIds={};\nfor(let s=0;s<5;s++){\n  const bar=comp('Tab Bar / '+tabs[s][0],2020,530+s*110,414,92,{fill:C.white});\n  rect(bar,'Hairline',0,0,414,1,{fill:'#EEF1EF'});\n  for(let i=0;i<5;i++){\n    const active=i===s;const col=active?C.green:C.gray;\n    await icon(bar,tabs[i][1],i*82.8+29,10,24,col);\n    txt(bar,'Label '+tabs[i][0],tabs[i][0],{size:11,style:active?'SemiBold':'Medium',color:col,w:82.8,h:16,align:'CENTER',x:i*82.8,y:40});\n  }\n  const hi=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('6:54');const hiI=hi.createInstance();bar.appendChild(hiI);hiI.x=0;hiI.y=58;\n  tabIds[tabs[s][0]]=bar.id;\n}\n\n// ---------- Product card ----------\nconst pcard=comp('Product Card',2560,60,173,250,{fill:C.white});\nconst tile=frame(pcard,'Image Tile',0,0,173,120,{fill:'#F7F8F7',r:16});\nconst pimg=rect(tile,'Image',0,0,173,120,{});\npimg.fills=[];\ntxt(pcard,'Name','Organic Bananas',{size:15,style:'SemiBold',color:C.ink,w:173,h:22,y:132});\ntxt(pcard,'Unit','7pcs, Price',{size:12,color:C.gray,w:173,h:18,y:156});\ntxt(pcard,'Price','$4.99',{size:17,style:'SemiBold',color:C.ink,w:120,h:24,y:186});\nconst add=rect(pcard,'Add',140,190,30,30,{fill:C.green,r:10});\nrect(pcard,'Add-H',146,203.5,12,2,{fill:C.white,r:1});\nrect(pcard,'Add-V',151,198.5,2,12,{fill:C.white,r:1});\n\n// ---------- Category card ----------\nconst ccard=comp('Category Card',2560,350,173,196,{fill:'#F7F8F7',r:18});\nconst cimg=rect(ccard,'Image',20,20,133,100,{});cimg.fills=[];\ntxt(ccard,'Name','Fresh Fruits & Vegetable',{size:14,style:'SemiBold',color:C.ink,w:173,h:40,align:'CENTER',x:0,y:134});\n\n// ---------- Cart row ----------\nconst crow=comp('Cart Row',2560,590,364,104,{fill:C.white});\nframe(crow,'Image Tile',0,0,64,64,{fill:'#F7F8F7',r:14});\nconst ci=rect(crow,'Image',4,4,56,56,{});ci.fills=[];\ntxt(crow,'Name','Bell Pepper Red',{size:15,style:'SemiBold',color:C.ink,w:170,h:22,x:80,y:2});\ntxt(crow,'Unit','1kg, Price',{size:12,color:C.gray,w:170,h:18,x:80,y:26});\ntxt(crow,'Price','$4.99',{size:16,style:'SemiBold',color:C.ink,w:90,h:22,x:80,y:56});\nconst stepper=step.createInstance();crow.appendChild(stepper);stepper.x=170;stepper.y=48;\nconst rm=frame(crow,'Remove',332,4,28,28,{});\nrect(rm,'X1',8,13,12,1.6,{fill:C.muted,r:1}).rotation=45;\nrect(rm,'X2',8,13,12,1.6,{fill:C.muted,r:1}).rotation=-45;\n\n// ---------- Checkout row ----------\nconst krow=comp('Checkout Row',2560,730,364,70,{fill:C.white});\nframe(krow,'Icon Tile',0,15,40,40,{fill:'#F7F8F7',r:12});\ntxt(krow,'Title','Delivery',{size:16,style:'SemiBold',color:C.ink,w:200,h:24,x:56,y:5});\ntxt(krow,'Value','Select Method',{size:14,color:C.gray,w:200,h:22,x:56,y:29});\nconst kch=await icon(krow,'4:124',336,23,16,C.ink);\n\n// ---------- Star ----------\nconst star=comp('Icon Star',2560,830,16,16,{fill:C.warn,clip:false});\nconst sv=figma.createVector();sv.name='Star Path';star.appendChild(sv);\nsv.vectorPaths=[{windingRule:'NONZERO',data:'M 12 1.5 L 14.9 9.1 L 23 9.6 L 16.7 14.8 L 18.7 22.7 L 12 18.4 L 5.3 22.7 L 7.3 14.8 L 1 9.6 L 9.1 9.1 Z'}];\nsv.resize(16,16);sv.x=0;sv.y=0;sv.fills=fl(C.warn);\n\nreturn JSON.stringify({tabs:tabIds, productCard:pcard.id, categoryCard:ccard.id, cartRow:crow.id, checkoutRow:krow.id, search:search.id, headerBack:hBack.id, headerPlain:hPlain.id, codeBox:codeBox.id, stepper:step.id, star:star.id, bPrimary:bPrimary.id, bDisabled:bDisabled.id, bSocial:bSocial.id, bSocialF:bSocialF.id, headerBackBig:hBackBig.id});","description":"Build the reusable component library in 03 Workspace: primary/disabled/social buttons, search bar, three headers, code input, quantity stepper, five tab-bar variants, product card, category card, cart row, checkout row, star icon.","fileKey":"1oPizmZzd4fjneLUff0gxt"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":8812,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":38140,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":8812}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ad82c274-46fa-45a8-a72d-d1f0c2787158","uuid":"8103f6b9-2060-42d3-a703-c96120455368","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:41:17.503Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01dlS0RTu614DuqMEThzY7NB","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
