{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJyR3yOBveYE5vZUNgkX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for the next batch of fixes to the prototype: the tab bar reactions that fail with a prototype-source error, the clipped back chevron in 04_Verification, and the left-margin text offsets across 02, 03, 04 and 06. I trace the tab bar failures to self-navigation: each of the 4 failed reactions (Shop to 9:6, Explore to 9:8, Cart to 9:10, Account to 9:13) targets the frame that contains its own source, so those get wired except the active tab, and per-segment hit rects of 82.8×92 go over the tab bar. The header arrow fix failed because the header is an instance of \"Header / Back\", so I edit the master components and add a vector arrow at x=20, y=14 for the 56-high header and y=26 for the 84-high one. I set x=24 on the titles and labels in 02, 03, 04 and 06, and x=24 for the carrot, flag and underline. On the Cart Row master and the checkout sheet I replace the rotated remove and close rects with two crossing vectors, so they read as an X rather than \"<\". These 3 edits are independent of each other and of the frame wiring, so they run in parallel.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":5799,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":165646,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5799}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ad82c274-46fa-45a8-a72d-d1f0c2787158","uuid":"0bec2c68-06c3-4ef0-abdf-f1acff986926","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:59:19.019Z","thinking_duration_ms":38021}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJyR3yOBveYE5vZUNgkX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here is what I still need, privately:\n\n1. **Back arrows** — the rotated chevron instances rendered clipped at the frame corner. They live inside header *component instances*, so they can't be edited in place; the fix must go into the master header components.\n2. **Left margins** — Product Detail, Onboarding, Sign In and Verification still have text at x=0 (the earlier repair call rolled back on an error).\n3. **Broken \"remove\"/\"close\" glyphs** — rotated rectangles render as \"<\" in cart rows and the checkout sheet.\n4. **Tab navigation** — the four tab-bar reactions failed because each wired tab pointed at its own frame. Per-segment hit areas are needed instead.\n5. **Final verification screenshots** of 03/04/06 and the tab flows.\n\nThe header, margin and glyph fixes are separate node trees, so I'll run all three writes together now."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":5799,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":165646,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5799}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ad82c274-46fa-45a8-a72d-d1f0c2787158","uuid":"a45aa2fc-f6d6-4180-99b6-b88e18625ab6","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:59:24.370Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJyR3yOBveYE5vZUNgkX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Ar0gK0RHx8rH1kScxHdgmz","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const ws=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:2');await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nfunction rgb(h){h=h.replace('#','');return {r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255};}\nfunction fl(h){return [{type:'SOLID',color:rgb(h)}];}\nfunction backChevron(p,x,y,scale,hex,w){\n  const v=figma.createVector();p.appendChild(v);v.name='Back Arrow';\n  v.vectorPaths=[{windingRule:'NONZERO',data:'M 13 2 L 4 11 L 13 20'}];\n  v.strokes=fl(hex);v.strokeWeight=w||2.2;v.fills=[];v.strokeCap='ROUND';v.strokeJoin='ROUND';\n  v.rescale(scale||0.9);v.x=x;v.y=y;return v;\n}\nconst log=[];\nfor(const nm of ['Header / Back','Header / Back + Subtitle']){\n  const c=ws.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT'&&n.name===nm);\n  if(!c){log.push('missing '+nm);continue;}\n  c.children.forEach(ch=>{if(ch.type==='INSTANCE')ch.visible=false;if(ch.name==='Back Arrow')ch.remove();});\n  backChevron(c,20,nm==='Header / Back'?15:25,0.9,'#181725',2.2);\n  log.push('fixed '+nm);\n}\nreturn JSON.stringify(log);","description":"Fix the master header components: hide the rotated chevron instance and add a clean vector back arrow.","fileKey":"1oPizmZzd4fjneLUff0gxt"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":5799,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":165646,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5799}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ad82c274-46fa-45a8-a72d-d1f0c2787158","uuid":"7aa4e473-fc36-4348-9d2d-9babccb4eda6","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:59:25.422Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Ar0gK0RHx8rH1kScxHdgmz","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ar0gK0RHx8rH1kScxHdgmz","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[\"fixed Header / Back\",\"fixed Header / Back + Subtitle\"]"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ad82c274-46fa-45a8-a72d-d1f0c2787158","uuid":"8a6310cf-8402-450c-b31f-9681d3c87dec","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:59:30.947Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"[\"fixed Header / Back\",\"fixed Header / Back + Subtitle\"]"}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"3eb5ae03-d5c5-4883-bf2e-4deff0a6d1f5"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Ar0gK0RHx8rH1kScxHdgmz","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJyR3yOBveYE5vZUNgkX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Jyz7B9PXxgxlnkO2fcutgK","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const ws=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:2');await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nconst out={};\n// ---- 02 Onboarding margins ----\nconst O=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('9:3');\n['Welcome','Welcome 2','Sub'].forEach(n=>{const t=O.children.find(c=>c.name===n);if(t)t.x=24;});\nconst carrot=O.children.find(c=>c.type==='INSTANCE'&&c.name==='Nectar_Carrot');if(carrot)carrot.x=24;\nout.onb=O.children.map(c=>[c.name,Math.round(c.x)]);\n// ---- 03 Sign In margins ----\nconst I=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('9:4');\n({'Title 1':24,'Title 2':24,'Phone label':24,'Code':68,'Placeholder':146});\nfor(const [n,x] of Object.entries({'Title 1':24,'Title 2':24,'Phone label':24,'Code':68,'Placeholder':146})){const t=I.children.find(c=>c.name===n);if(t)t.x=x;}\n['Flag','Underline','Rule L'].forEach(n=>{const r=I.children.find(c=>c.name===n);if(r)r.x=24;});\nout.sign=I.children.map(c=>[c.name,Math.round(c.x)]);\n// ---- 04 Verification margins ----\nconst V=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('9:5');\nfor(const [n,x] of Object.entries({'Title':24,'Title 2':24,'Code label':24})){const t=V.children.find(c=>c.name===n);if(t)t.x=x;}\nout.ver=V.children.map(c=>[c.name,Math.round(c.x)]);\n// ---- 06 Product Detail margins ----\nconst D=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('9:7');\n['Name','Unit','PD Title','Description','Nutritions','Review'].forEach(n=>{const t=D.children.find(c=>c.name===n);if(t)t.x=24;});\nout.pd=D.children.map(c=>[c.name,Math.round(c.x)]);\n// ---- Cart Row: rebuild remove glyph as vector X ----\nconst cr=ws.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT'&&n.name==='Cart Row');\nif(cr){\n  cr.children.filter(c=>c.name==='Remove'||c.name==='X1'||c.name==='X2').forEach(c=>c.remove());\n  const x=figma.createVector();cr.appendChild(x);x.name='Remove';\n  x.vectorPaths=[{windingRule:'NONZERO',data:'M 0 0 L 12 12 M 12 0 L 0 12'}];\n  x.strokes=[{type:'SOLID',color:{r:0.694,g:0.694,b:0.694}}];x.strokeWeight=1.6;x.fills=[];\n  x.x=340;x.y=14;\n  out.cartRow='fixed';\n}\n// ---- Checkout sheet close glyph ----\nconst CK=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('9:11');\nconst sheet=CK.children.find(c=>c.name==='Checkout Sheet');\nif(sheet){\n  sheet.children.filter(c=>c.name==='Close X1'||c.name==='Close X2').forEach(c=>c.remove());\n  const x=figma.createVector();sheet.appendChild(x);x.name='Close Glyph';\n  x.vectorPaths=[{windingRule:'NONZERO',data:'M 0 0 L 14 14 M 14 0 L 0 14'}];\n  x.strokes=[{type:'SOLID',color:{r:0.094,g:0.09,b:0.145}}];x.strokeWeight=2;x.fills=[];\n  x.x=366;x.y=38;\n  out.sheet='fixed';\n}\nreturn JSON.stringify(out);","description":"Fix left margins on Onboarding, Sign In, Verification and Product Detail; replace broken rotated remove/close glyphs with vector X marks.","fileKey":"1oPizmZzd4fjneLUff0gxt"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":5799,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":165646,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5799}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ad82c274-46fa-45a8-a72d-d1f0c2787158","uuid":"277765be-6c2c-4ab8-a9d2-c6dfbe0778d3","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:59:34.007Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Jyz7B9PXxgxlnkO2fcutgK","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
